Source landscape: The documentary universe is broad and cross-disciplinary. It includes U.S. executive and agency records, treaty and inspection documentation, congressional/CRS materials, NNSA and FAS technical assessments, international nuclear-safety records, cybersecurity and AI policy documents, academic work, investigative analysis, and favorable, adverse, mixed, and exculpatory reporting. Candidate coverage is strongest for nuclear posture, New START, Ukraine-related escalation risk, AI, and cyber policy; command-and-control, expert dissent, biological risk, and measurable end-of-period outcomes require further inspection.

